    # Multi-Step PDF Upload Workflow - Complete Implementation ✅

## Overview

Successfully implemented a complete redesign of the PDF upload and processing workflow from a single-step process to a 5-step user workflow with file staging, review, processing, and selective saving.

## Architecture Implemented

### 5-Step User Workflow

1. **Upload** - Files uploaded (folder or email) without processing
2. **Review Uploaded Files** - Table displays files with email metadata, option to remove
3. **Process Documents** - User triggers OCR processing
4. **Review Results** - View PDFs, see extracted data, select files to save
5. **Save and Finish** - Selected invoices saved to database

---

## Backend Implementation ✅

### Database Layer

#### Schema ([database/schema.sql](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/database/schema.sql))
```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS upload_staging (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    session_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    filename TEXT NOT NULL,
    file_path TEXT NOT NULL,
    file_size INTEGER NOT NULL,
    email_subject TEXT,
    email_sender TEXT,
    email_folder TEXT,  -- ✅ Added per user request
    email_date TEXT,
    uploaded_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
```

**Indexes:**
- `idx_staging_session` on [session_id](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/routes/upload_routes.py#46-51)
- `idx_staging_uploaded_at` on `uploaded_at`

#### Model ([database/models.py](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/database/models.py))
- Added [UploadStaging](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/database/models.py#41-54) dataclass with all metadata fields

#### Repository ([repositories/upload_staging_repository.py](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py))
- [create()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#22-57) - Insert staged file
- [get_by_session()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#58-81) - Retrieve session files
- [delete_by_filename()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#107-131) - Remove single file
- [delete_by_session()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#132-155) - Clear all session files
- [cleanup_old_uploads()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#156-179) - Remove old staged data

### API Endpoints

**New Blueprint:** [routes/upload_routes.py](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/routes/upload_routes.py) registered at `/api/upload`

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/stage` | POST | Upload files to staging (no processing) |
| `/staged` | GET | Get staged files for current session |
| `/staged/<filename>` | DELETE | Remove staged file |
| `/process` | POST | OCR process staged files |
| `/finalize` | POST | Save selected invoices to DB |
| `/view-pdf/<filename>` | GET | Stream PDF for browser viewing |

**Session Management:**
- Flask session cookies maintain `upload_session_id`
- Files stored in `uploads/temp/<session_id>/`
- Database tracks files by session_id

### Email Service Updates ([services/email_service.py](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/services/email_service.py))

**Changed Return Type:**
- **Before:** `List[Tuple[str, str]]` - (filename, filepath)
- **After:** `List[Dict[str, Any]]` - Full metadata dicts

**Metadata Captured:**
- [filename](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#107-131) - PDF filename
- `filepath` - Full file path
- [folder](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/services/email_service.py#88-110) - Email folder name
- `email_subject` - Email subject line
- `email_sender` - Email from address
- `email_date` - Email date

### Email Import Endpoint ([routes/api_routes.py](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/routes/api_routes.py))

**Updated `/api/email/import` function:**
- ✅ Creates session-based temp directory
- ✅ Saves files to [upload_staging](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/repositories/upload_staging_repository.py#82-106) table
- ✅ Captures email folder metadata
- ✅ Returns SSE stream with progress
- ❌ **Removed** immediate OCR processing
- ❌ **Removed** automatic database saving

