## Implementation Notes

**Why Staging Table vs. Session Storage?**
- More scalable for large file lists
- Survives server restarts
- Allows for admin monitoring/cleanup
- Database-backed = reliable

**Why Session Cookies?**
- Native Flask session management
- Secure, encrypted cookies
- No additional storage needed
- Transparent to frontend

**Email Import Integration:**
- Modified [fetch_pdf_attachments()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/services/email_service.py#125-210) to return rich metadata
- Updated [_process_email()](file:///c:/Projects/faktura_scanner_flask/services/email_service.py#211-300) to extract email headers
- Changed endpoint to stage instead of process
- Maintained SSE progress reporting

